    "code": "\tSELECTOR\n\t\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\t\tIF IsObjectApproached? THEN\n\t\t\t\tDO TakeObject\n\t\tELSE\n\t\t\tDO ProcessObjectTasks\n\t\tEND\n\t\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\t\tIF IsObjectVisible? THEN\n\t\t\t\tDO GoToObject\n\t\tEND\n\t\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\t\tIF IsPathBlocked? THEN\n\t\t\t\tDO AvoidObstacle\n\t\tEND\n\t\tDO ScanAreaForObject\n\tEND\n"
